# MedShadow Design Guidelines

## Color Palette
- Primary Navy: `#14213D`, `#1A365D` - Used for backgrounds, buttons, and text
- Gold Accent: `#FCA311` - Used for highlights, accents, and CTAs
- Neutral Grays: `#4B5563`, `#F8FAFC` - Used for text and backgrounds

## UI Components

### Cards
Cards use a consistent style with:
- Light background (`#F8FAFC`)
- Subtle border (`border-neutral-200`)
- Top accent bar (`bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FCA311] to-[#FCA311]/60`)
- Hover effects (`group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:border-[#FCA311]/30`)

### Buttons
- Primary: Gold background with white text
- Secondary: Transparent with border

### Typography
- Headings: Navy blue (`#14213D`), bold
- Body text: Dark gray (`#4B5563`)
- Link text: Gold (`#FCA311`)

## Section Layout
- Hero section: Gradient background with overlay image
- Feature sections: White/light gray alternating backgrounds
- Text-heavy sections: Centered content with max-width constraints
